# Predicting Unresolved NYC 311 Complaints

This project uses NYC 311 data to predict whether a complaint may remain unresolved.

## Tools
Python, Pandas, Scikit-learn, Jupyter Notebook

## Dataset
The original dataset was too large for GitHub, so I used a smaller sampled version: `sample_data.csv`.

## Model
Logistic Regression

## Evaluation
The model was evaluated using accuracy, precision, recall, and a confusion matrix.

## Summary
This project shows how machine learning can be used to identify complaints that may need more attention.

